        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu n’abigishwa biwe begereje i Yerusalemu, bashika ahitwa Betifage ku Musozi wa Elayono. Yesu aca atuma babiri mu bigishwa ngo babitangire imbere, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.21.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
